  "build": {
    "buildCommand": "cat > /tmp/commit_phase3.txt << 'EOF'\nfeat: Lyra v4.0.0 - Phase 3: Hooks System Integration\n\n🎣 Hooks System Integration Complete\n\nIntegrated ECC's hooks system with Lyra's lifecycle-based architecture.\n\n## New Module: lyra_ecc/lifecycle_integration.py (120 lines)\n\n### ECCLifecycleIntegration\n- Bridges ECC hooks with Lyra's LifecycleBus\n- Subscribes to 3 lifecycle events (TOOL_CALL, SESSION_START, SESSION_END)\n- Translates lifecycle events to ECC hook types\n- Enables event-driven automation\n\n### Features\n- **Lifecycle Integration**: Seamless bridge between ECC and Lyra hooks\n- **Event Translation**: Maps Lyra lifecycle events to ECC hook types\n- **Custom Hook Registration**: Support for user-defined hooks\n- **Hook Summary**: Statistics and monitoring for registered hooks\n\n### Hook Types Supported\n1. **PRE_TOOL_USE** - Validation, parameter modification\n2. **POST_TOOL_USE** - Auto-format, type checking, linting\n3. **SESSION_START** - Load context, initialize memory\n4. **SESSION_END** - Save state, generate summary\n5. **STOP** - Final verification\n\n### Auto-Format Hooks (Built-in)\n- **Python**: black formatter\n- **TypeScript/JavaScript**: prettier\n- **Go**: gofmt\n\n### Type-Check Hooks (Built-in)\n- **Python**: mypy\n- **TypeScript**: tsc --noEmit\n\n## Tests: 44 passing (8 new lifecycle tests)\n- TestECCLifecycleIntegration (7 tests)\n- TestSetupECCHooks (1 test)\n- Coverage: 67% overall, 100% for lifecycle_integration.py\n\n## Integration\n- Updated `lyra_ecc/__init__.py` to export lifecycle classes\n- Added `setup_ecc_hooks()` helper function\n- Full compatibility with Lyra's LifecycleBus\n\n## Technical Details\n- **Event-Driven**: Hooks fire automatically on lifecycle events\n- **Type-Safe**: Complete type annotations\n- **Async Support**: Hooks can be sync or async\n- **Error Handling**: Graceful error handling with logging\n\n## Statistics\n- **New Code**: 120 lines (lifecycle_integration.py) + 150 lines (tests)\n- **Test Coverage**: 100% for lifecycle integration\n- **Total Tests**: 44 passing\n- **Zero Breaking Changes**: Backward compatible\n\n## Usage Example\n```python\nfrom lyra_core.hooks import LifecycleBus\nfrom lyra_ecc import setup_ecc_hooks\n\n# Initialize lifecycle bus\nlifecycle_bus = LifecycleBus()\n\n# Set up ECC hooks integration\nintegration = setup_ecc_hooks(lifecycle_bus)\n\n# Register custom hook\ndef my_hook(context):\n    return HookResult(success=True)\n\nintegration.register_custom_hook(HookType.POST_TOOL_USE, my_hook)\n```\n\n## Next Steps\n- Phase 4: Rules Engine Integration\n- Phase 5: UI/UX Excellence\n- Phase 6: Security Integration\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ncat /tmp/commit_phase3.txt",
